        "chars": 102,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 17.9
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        298,
        1238,
        890,
        1466
      ],
      "category": "List-item",
      "text": "(iii) a contract with a contractor who has received a certificate of compliance with the equal employment opportunity requirements of applicable law from the Bureau within the preceding twenty-four months, or an appropriate agency of the State of New York or of the United States within the preceding twelve months, except as the Bureau may direct by regulation.\"",
